--[[
    Mouse Steering (BeamNG style) - Car Dealership Tycoon  (v6)
    J = toggle mouse steering (also runs "fixcam")
    I = open/close settings menu (Smooth, Sensitivity, Apply)

    - Cursor X position = steering (screen center = straight). Up/down is ignored.
    - Steering is sent as A/D pulses, so it behaves like an analog joystick.
    - HOLD RIGHT CLICK to look around, SCROLL to zoom.
    - Running the script again removes the previous copy automatically.

    After executing, choose your platform:
      PC     = the keyboard + mouse controls above (J, X, I, N).
      Mobile = on-screen steering wheel + a "Menus" button that opens both menus.
               One finger drags the camera, two fingers pinch to zoom.
               Gas / Brake buttons bottom-right. "Move" lets you drag the wheel and pedals
               anywhere, "Lock" fixes them. The wheel stays where you leave it.
]]

