-- swingSpeed: how fast the camera swings out when a drift starts (higher = faster)
-- returnSpeed: how fast the camera swings back when the drift ends (higher = faster)
-- gforce: strength of the G-force camera (0 = off, 1 = normal, 2 = extreme)
-- fovMin / fovMax: field of view when slow/stopped and at max speed/acceleration/drift
-- swingMax: max angle (degrees) the camera swings around the car while drifting
-- maxAngle: how far the front wheels turn at full steering (0.4 is what the game's own steering uses)
-- smooth: 0 = instant, higher = smoother/slower (try 0 - 10)
-- sensitivity: higher = less cursor travel needed for full steering (try 0.3 - 4)

